{
  "id": "typescript-17-project-references",
  "slug": "project-references",
  "title": "Project references and monorepo typecheck strategy",
  "moduleId": "typescript-17-compiler-options-tooling",
  "order": 3,
  "hook": "**Project references** split monorepos — `composite: true`, `references: [{ path }]`, build with `tsc -b` and `.tsbuildinfo` incremental cache.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "What is this?",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Child tsconfig **composite** + **declaration**. Parent **references** children. **tsc -b** topological build. **declarationMap** for cross-package go-to-def. paths aliases ≠ references — references define build graph."
        },
        {
          "type": "glossary",
          "title": "Key terms",
          "entries": [
            {
              "term": "composite",
              "longForm": "composite project",
              "plainDefinition": "Enables references + tsbuildinfo.",
              "example": "composite true"
            },
            {
              "term": "references",
              "longForm": "project refs",
              "plainDefinition": "Dependent tsconfig paths.",
              "example": "references array"
            },
            {
              "term": "tsc -b",
              "longForm": "build mode",
              "plainDefinition": "Solution build ordered.",
              "example": "tsc -b --verbose"
            },
            {
              "term": "solution tsconfig",
              "longForm": "root",
              "plainDefinition": "files [] references all pkgs.",
              "example": "root tsconfig"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Why does it matter?",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Monorepo without refs typechecks all always — slow CI. Nx/Turbo wrap tsc -b. C# solution file analog."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "variant": "tip",
          "title": "Interview trap: paths vs references",
          "body": "paths = editor alias; references = build graph + incremental."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "How it works step by step",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "steps",
          "title": "Mental model",
          "items": [
            {
              "title": "composite packages",
              "body": "declaration true"
            },
            {
              "title": "references in deps",
              "body": "List dependent packages in references array and build with tsc -b in topological order."
            },
            {
              "title": "root solution",
              "body": "files empty"
            },
            {
              "title": "CI tsc -b",
              "body": "cache tsbuildinfo"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "diagram": {
            "type": "mermaid",
            "title": "monorepo refs",
            "source": "flowchart BT\n  APP --> LIB\n  APP --> API\n  API --> SHARED"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Code walkthrough",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "snippet",
          "snippet": {
            "language": "json",
            "label": "composite package",
            "code": "{\n  \"compilerOptions\": { \"composite\": true, \"declaration\": true, \"declarationMap\": true, \"outDir\": \"dist\" },\n  \"include\": [\"src\"]\n}",
            "explanation": "Library composite."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "snippet",
          "snippet": {
            "language": "json",
            "label": "app references lib",
            "code": "{\n  \"compilerOptions\": { \"composite\": true },\n  \"references\": [{ \"path\": \"../shared\" }],\n  \"include\": [\"src\"]\n}",
            "explanation": "Dependency graph."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "snippet",
          "snippet": {
            "language": "json",
            "label": "root solution",
            "code": "{\n  \"files\": [],\n  \"references\": [\n    { \"path\": \"./packages/shared\" },\n    { \"path\": \"./apps/web\" }\n  ]\n}",
            "explanation": "tsc -b from root."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "snippet",
          "snippet": {
            "language": "bash",
            "label": "CI build",
            "code": "tsc -b tsconfig.json --pretty false",
            "explanation": "Incremental monorepo typecheck."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
